    <Description><![CDATA[Layout Composer Ola 42.5 — Hijo de elementLayoutGrid con columnSpan custom de 1 a 12. No se usa fuera de un Grid padre (allowAtRoot=false, solo existe dentro del area "gridColumns"). Topología: 1 area "columnContent" (12 cols internos). Opt-in: compDomClass + compDomVariant + compDomSpacing + compDomPresetChrome. Variations=Culture. Renderer: Views/Partials/blockgrid/Components/elementLayoutColumn.cshtml. Backoffice preview: App_Plugins/LayoutComposer/views/block-column.html.]]></Description>
